### Crear calendario
POST http://localhost:8085/api/calendars
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ownerEntityId": 1,
  "name": "Calendario de prueba",
  "description": "Prueba de CRUD y recurrencia",
  "defaultColor": "#3366CC",
  "timezone": "Europe/Madrid"
}

### Crear evento semanal recurrente lunes y miércoles
POST http://localhost:8085/api/calendars/2/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Entrenamiento Infantil A",
  "description": "Entrenamiento de pista",
  "startsAt": "2026-10-05T18:00:00",
  "endsAt": "2026-10-05T19:30:00",
  "timezone": "Europe/Madrid",
  "recurrence": {
    "frequency": "WEEKLY",
    "interval": 1,
    "daysOfWeek": ["MO", "WE"],
    "until": "2026-12-20T23:59:59",
    "timezone": "Europe/Madrid"
  }
}

### Consultar ocurrencias en rango
GET http://localhost:8085/api/calendars/2/events?from=2026-10-01T00:00:00&to=2026-11-01T00:00:00

### Modificar solo una ocurrencia
# Sustituye 1 por el seriesEventId devuelto por el POST/GET.
PATCH http://localhost:8085/api/events/1?occurrenceStartsAt=2026-10-07T18:00:00&scope=SINGLE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startsAt": "2026-10-07T19:00:00",
  "endsAt": "2026-10-07T20:30:00",
  "title": "Entrenamiento Infantil A - cambio puntual"
}

### Modificar esta ocurrencia y las siguientes
PATCH http://localhost:8085/api/events/1?occurrenceStartsAt=2026-10-12T18:00:00&scope=THIS_AND_FOLLOWING
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startsAt": "2026-10-12T18:30:00",
  "endsAt": "2026-10-12T20:00:00"
}

### Modificar toda la serie
PATCH http://localhost:8085/api/events/1?scope=ALL
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Entrenamiento Infantil A - temporada"
}

### Eliminar solo una ocurrencia
DELETE http://localhost:8085/api/events/1?occurrenceStartsAt=2026-10-14T18:00:00&scope=SINGLE

### Eliminar esta ocurrencia y las siguientes
DELETE http://localhost:8085/api/events/1?occurrenceStartsAt=2026-11-02T18:00:00&scope=THIS_AND_FOLLOWING

### Eliminar toda la serie
DELETE http://localhost:8085/api/events/1?scope=ALL
